<title>UK: INSIGHT - Platinum market may re-try $500 barrier.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - Platinum market may re-try $500 barrier.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   343.95/4.95 *  339.00 * 347.00 *    51 * 343.59 * 343.32</p>
<p> SILVER   4.76/4.78 *    4.75 *   4.85 *    50 *   4.76 *   4.75</p>
<p> PLAT   461.00/6.00 *  450.00 * 500.00 *    81 * 423.31 * 397.38</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - June 10---------------</p>
<p>Platinum prices could continue Monday's sideways pattern on Tuesday before making another push on the psychologically significant $500 mark, analysts said.</p>
<p>Gold has to get over a downtrend line stretching back to November 1996 at $345.50 if upside progress is to be achieved, they said.</p>
